OL,3,GNEWSACare home firm fined #52k after   
OL,4,Aresident injured                       
OL,6,FA care home operator has been fined    
OL,7,Fafter one of its residents suffered    
OL,8,Fmultiple deep tissue injuries during   
OL,9,Fhis three-week stay.                   
OL,11,FThe man was admitted to Holme House    
OL,12,FCare Home in Gomersal in April 2023,   
OL,13,Fbut after being discharged the         
OL,14,Ffollowing month it was noticed he had  
OL,15,Finjuries to his thigh, heels, ankles   
OL,16,Fand between his knees.                 
OL,18,FBradford Magistrates' Court was told   
OL,19,Fthe resident should have been          
OL,20,Fre-positioned around six times more    
OL,21,Fthan care home logs suggested he was,  
OL,22,Fto avoid getting pressure sores.       
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
