OL,3,GNEWSACare home firm fined #52k after   
OL,4,Aresident injured                       
OL,6,FMilelands Ltd, which owns the home, was
OL,7,Ffined #52,000 after admitting "failing 
OL,8,Fto provide safe care and treatment" to 
OL,9,Fthe man, "exposing him to significant  
OL,10,Frisk of avoidable harm".               
